{"3809110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Japan Stigmatized Property -日本事故物件監視協会-", "steam_appid": 3809110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game focuses on Japanese-style psychological horror and subtle, atmospheric fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not based on jump scares, action, or chase scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to observe real-world locations in Japan and report any abnormal phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Japanese urban legends, this experience blends horror with visual attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may find the horror “quiet”—but it lingers in your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy subtle, unsettling vibes over gore or action, this game is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To All Employees,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a surveillance officer of Japan Stigmatized Property</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate the security cameras installed throughout the property and monitor for any signs of anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you discover anything unusual, report it immediately</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure to report anomalies or repeated mistakes will result in a mission failure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conversely, if you can maintain surveillance from midnight to 5 a.m., the mission will be considered successful</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Mission Features]</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be assigned to real-life properties located within Japan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies will occur randomly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of phenomena that can only be observed through either the night vision camera or the regular camera</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Examples of Anomalies]</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furniture moving, objects disappearing or appearing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intrusion by human figures or spirits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighting malfunctions, floating orbs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodstains on walls, video distortion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And other phenomena beyond imagination</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Work Hours]</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be in charge of 4 properties in total</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surveillance duties run from 12:00 a.m. to 5:00 a.m.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between Standard or Special Assignment difficulty modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Other Notes]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and broadcasting while conducting duties is permitted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We place no restrictions on monetization or Super Chats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Submission of permission requests is not required for either individuals or corporate entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please commence your duties.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game focuses on Japanese-style psychological horror and subtle, atmospheric fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not based on jump scares, action, or chase scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to observe real-world locations in Japan and report any abnormal phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Japanese urban legends, this experience blends horror with visual attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may find the horror “quiet”—but it lingers in your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy subtle, unsettling vibes over gore or action, this game is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To All Employees,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a surveillance officer of Japan Stigmatized Property</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate the security cameras installed throughout the property and monitor for any signs of anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you discover anything unusual, report it immediately</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure to report anomalies or repeated mistakes will result in a mission failure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conversely, if you can maintain surveillance from midnight to 5 a.m., the mission will be considered successful</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Mission Features]</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be assigned to real-life properties located within Japan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies will occur randomly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of phenomena that can only be observed through either the night vision camera or the regular camera</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Examples of Anomalies]</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furniture moving, objects disappearing or appearing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intrusion by human figures or spirits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighting malfunctions, floating orbs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodstains on walls, video distortion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And other phenomena beyond imagination</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Work Hours]</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be in charge of 4 properties in total</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surveillance duties run from 12:00 a.m. to 5:00 a.m.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between Standard or Special Assignment difficulty modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Other Notes]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and broadcasting while conducting duties is permitted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We place no restrictions on monetization or Super Chats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Submission of permission requests is not required for either individuals or corporate entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please commence your duties.</p>", "short_description": "Can you endure until morning Monitor Japan's stigmatized properties and report any paranormal activity If you miss a report or make repeated mistakes——", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809110/45535eab1be845a0529e4eb546621821955b75df/header.jpg?t=1766482045", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809110/b7a85cd7308dae63c519dadb8a06a136f5babe9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766482045", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809110/b7a85cd7308dae63c519dadb8a06a136f5babe9e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766482045", "website": "https://jp-stigmatized-property.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 compatible GPU (Integrated graphics supported)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul cl